WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Native Android validation app on a connected Lenovo tablet. Fictional local activity; silent screen recording.

00:03.000 --> 00:23.000
OpenClaw first emerges from the shared shell and settles onto its own rock. Gateway availability keeps it outside while idle.

00:23.000 --> 00:54.000
Hermes and Dot emerge in turn, then move to separate places. The doorway closes once everyone clears it.

00:54.000 --> 01:20.000
Activity stops. Hermes and Dot return through the front lane. Hermes rises above the lip before tucking inside.

01:20.000 --> 01:35.000
Hermes and Dot are inside; their floating labels are hidden. OpenClaw continues resting on its rock.

01:35.000 --> 02:14.800
The gateway disconnects. OpenClaw returns through the same mouth; the shell closes after its body clears.
